{"is_source_file": true, "format": "C++", "description": "This source file implements a class `IRToProtobufConverter` and `ProtobufIRDumper` responsible for converting internal IR (intermediate representation) types and symbols into Protocol Buffer (protobuf) messages for serialization. It includes functions for converting various IR types like record types, function types, enums, global variables, and other C++ type representations into protobuf formats, and methods to add these to a protobuf message tree. The file also contains functions to dump a complete module IR into a protobuf text file. It is tightly coupled with protobuf message definitions and provides serialization of IR constructs for further processing or analysis.", "external_files": ["repr/protobuf/abi_dump.h", "repr/protobuf/api.h", "<fstream>", "<memory>", "<llvm/Support/raw_ostream.h>", "<google/protobuf/io/zero_copy_stream_impl.h>", "<google/protobuf/text_format.h>"], "external_methods": ["llvm::errs()", "google::protobuf::TextFormat::Print()", "google::protobuf::io::OstreamOutputStream"], "published": ["CreateProtobufIRDumper"], "classes": [{"name": "IRToProtobufConverter", "description": "A class responsible for converting IR types and symbols into protobuf message formats."}, {"name": "ProtobufIRDumper", "description": "A class responsible for dumping IR data into protobuf message instances and serializing to files."}], "methods": [{"name": "bool AddTemplateInformation(abi_dump::TemplateInfo * ti,const TemplatedArtifactIR * ta)", "description": "Adds template info from IR to protobuf.", "scope": "header_checker::repr::IRToProtobufConverter", "scopeKind": "class"}, {"name": "bool AddTypeInfo(abi_dump::BasicNamedAndTypedDecl * type_info,const TypeIR * typep)", "description": "Populates protobuf type info based on IR type.", "scope": "header_checker::repr::IRToProtobufConverter", "scopeKind": "class"}, {"name": "bool AddRecordFields(abi_dump::RecordType * record_protobuf,const RecordTypeIR * recor